<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>7.5.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01814</md:content-id>
    <md:title>7.5.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b45660f9-17a0-4061-9caf-d3345b199ea6</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001">
    <para id="para-00001">An object is dropped from a building and falls so that the distance in feet it falls, \(d(t)\), is found by \(d(t)=16t^2\), after \(t\) seconds. How many feet has it fallen after 10 seconds?</para>
  </section>
</content>
